# Real key presses in the order ticket's price box: the same regrouping, caret and delete rules
# as the bond amount box. Places nothing.
name limit price box: typing regroups, the caret keeps its digit, deleting skips separators
show-buy Oil
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
keys FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField end backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace backspace
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField
keys FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 5 0 0 0 0 0
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 500,000
expect-caret FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 7
keys FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField home 1
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1,500,000
expect-caret FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1
keys FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField right backspace
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 500,000
expect-caret FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 0
keys FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField right right right delete
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 50,000
expect-caret FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 4
# an eighth digit is not taken
keys FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField end 1 2 3
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 5,000,012
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitHint 5,000,012
cleanup:
blur FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField
close-dialog
